      "before": "default",
      "after": "default"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "<h2> 1. Misconception: </h2>",
     "body": "<h4><i>»Our tool data lies in extensive Excel spreadsheets. We can't possibly perform the transmission of that data manually into a tool management system.«</i></h4>",
     "images": [],
     "videos": [],
     "pos": "text",
     "cols": 1,
     "valign": "top",
     "ftype": "text",
     "id": "c99124",
     "bg": "",
     "space": {
      "before": "default",
      "after": "default"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "<h2> The ZOLLER solution: </h2>",
     "body": "<p>With ZOLLER, there is absolutely no need to enter Excel data manually. The import filter in the ZOLLER software handles the import quickly and simply. For one customer, ZOLLER imported Excel data for 140 tools into the z.One tool database in no time at all.</p> <hr/>",
     "images": [],
     "videos": [],
     "pos": "text",
     "cols": 1,
     "valign": "top",
     "ftype": "text",
     "id": "c99123",
     "bg": "",
     "space": {
      "before": "default",
      "after": "default"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "",
     "body": "",
     "images": [
      {
       "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/1/csm_fuenf_irrtuermer_contentimg_02_24c3d5269f.webp",
       "alt": "",
       "w": 1420,
       "h": 790
      }
     ],
     "videos": [],
     "pos": "above",
     "cols": 1,
     "valign": "top",
     "ftype": "textmedia",
     "id": "c99125",
     "bg": "",
     "space": {
      "before": "default",
      "after": "default"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "<h2> 2. Misconception: </h2>",
     "body": "<h4><i>»For us, as a small manufacturing operation, digital inventory management doesn't make sense. We already know where our tools lie.«</i></h4>",
     "images": [],
     "videos": [],
     "pos": "text",
     "cols": 1,
     "valign": "top",
     "ftype": "text",
     "id": "c99126",
     "bg": "",
     "space": {
      "before": "default",
      "after": "default"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "<h2> The ZOLLER solution: </h2>",
     "body": "<p>Everyone knows how frustrating it can be to search for a tool or component. The next order is waiting, time is running out, and stress levels are rising. For one customer, ZOLLER has set up inventory location management so that a tool’s storage location is automatically listed on the setup sheets. This ensures that tool preparation runs smoothly.</p> <hr/>",
     "images": [],
     "videos": [],
     "pos": "text",
     "cols": 1,
     "valign": "top",
     "ftype": "text",
     "id": "c99127",
     "bg": "",
     "space": {
      "before": "default",
      "after": "default"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "",
     "body": "",
     "images": [
      {
       "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/e/csm_fuenf_irrtuermer_contentimg_03_f2c8f17d5b.webp",
       "alt": "",
       "w": 1420,
       "h": 790
      }
     ],
     "videos": [],
     "pos": "above",
     "cols": 1,
     "valign": "top",
     "ftype": "textmedia",
     "id": "c99128",
     "bg": "",
     "space": {
      "before": "default",
      "after": "default"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "<h2> 3. Misconception: </h2>",
     "body": "<h4><i>»There's no need to transfer tool data digitally. Our machine operators are so experienced—they've always provided all the inputs by hand.«</i></h4>",
     "images": [],
     "videos": [],
     "pos": "text",
     "cols": 1,
     "valign": "top",
     "ftype": "text",
     "id": "c99129",
     "bg": "",
     "space": {
      "before": "default",
      "after": "default"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "<h2> The ZOLLER solution: </h2>",
     "body": "<p>Entering all tool data manually into the CNC machine every time is not time-efficient—not to mention the danger of a transposed digit creeping in. With »zidCode«, data transfer is fast and error-free. This ZOLLER solution performs automated transfer of relevant tool data to the CNC machine’s control system.</p> <hr/>",
     "images": [],
     "videos": [],
     "pos": "text",
     "cols": 1,
     "valign": "top",
     "ftype": "text",
     "id": "c99130",
     "bg": "",
     "space": {
      "before": "default",
      "after": "default"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "",
     "body": "",
     "images": [
      {
       "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/7/csm_fuenf_irrtuermer_contentimg_04_5592f392d0.webp",
       "alt": "",
       "w": 1420,
       "h": 790
      }
     ],
     "videos": [],
     "pos": "above",
     "cols": 1,
     "valign": "top",
     "ftype": "textmedia",
     "id": "c99131",
     "bg": "",
     "space": {
      "before": "default",
      "after": "default"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "<h2> 4. Misconception: </h2>",
     "body": "<h4><i>»Downtime tracking? It's not worth it. For us as a small business, it's far too time-consuming to enter, record, retrieve, and evaluate downtime. The effort is out of proportion to the use.«</i></h4>",
     "images": [],
     "videos": [],
     "pos": "text",
     "cols": 1,
     "valign": "top",
     "ftype": "text",
     "id": "c99132",
     "bg": "",
     "space": {
      "before": "default",
      "after": "default"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "<h2> The ZOLLER solution: </h2>",
     "body": "<p>Tool life data is valuable for production and cost planning. With the »flash« software, you can immediately see how much remaining tool life your tools have. This allows you to optimize tool changes and reduce costly machine downtime.</p> <hr/>",
     "images": [],
     "videos": [],
     "pos": "text",
     "cols": 1,
     "valign": "top",
     "ftype": "text",
     "id": "c99133",
     "bg": "",
     "space": {
      "before": "default",
      "after": "default"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "",
     "body": "",
     "images": [
      {
       "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/e/csm_fuenf_irrtuermer_contentimg_05_16c3b368f8.webp",
       "alt": "",
       "w": 1420,
       "h": 790
      }
     ],
     "videos": [],
     "pos": "above",
     "cols": 1,
     "valign": "top",
     "ftype": "textmedia",
     "id": "c99135",
     "bg": "",
     "space": {
      "before": "default",
      "after": "default"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "<h2> 5. Misconception: </h2>",
     "body": "<h4><i>»There are ten of us, so no one can take care of the network. Besides, we don't know anything about it.«</i></h4>",
     "images": [],
     "videos": [],
     "pos": "text",
     "cols": 1,
     "valign": "top",
     "ftype": "text",
     "id": "c99136",
     "bg": "",
     "space": {
      "before": "default",
      "after": "default"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "<h2> The ZOLLER solution: </h2>",
     "body": "<p>Digitalization requires networking. Yet many operations view networks as a critical point. This raises valid questions such as: “What if the network fails? That would mean significant downtime.” ZOLLER offers high-quality, cost-effective, and secure solutions that are simple to manage and reliably fulfill their purpose.</p> <hr/>",
     "images": [],
     "videos": [],
     "pos": "text",
     "cols": 1,
     "valign": "top",
     "ftype": "text",
     "id": "c99137",
     "bg": "",
     "space": {
      "before": "default",
      "after": "default"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "<h2> Get More Out of Your Manufacturing Process </h2>",
     "body": "<p>When we examine common misconceptions about digitalization, it becomes clear that <strong>digitalization</strong> has a positive effect even on small businesses—through significant <strong>cost savings,</strong> increased <strong>safety</strong>, and greater <strong>productivity.</strong> Today, digitalization is no longer an option but necessary for staying competitive.</p> <p>ZOLLER is a pioneer in the digitalization of processes related to cutting tools. We’d be happy to guide you into the digital future with solutions that are field-tested and interoperable. They work just as well in small operations as they do in Industry 4.0 companies.</p>",
     "images": [],
     "videos": [],
     "pos": "text",
     "cols": 1,
     "valign": "top",
     "ftype": "text",
     "id": "c99138",
     "bg": "",
